<title>FINLAND: POHJOLA SEEKS SUSPENSION OF TRADE.</title>
<headline>POHJOLA SEEKS SUSPENSION OF TRADE.</headline>
<text>
<p>HELSINKI, Jan 23 (Reuter) Finnish insurance group Vakuutusosakeyhtio Pohjola on Thursday sought suspension of trade in its share on the Helsinki bourse pending a news conference at 1000/0800 GMT, a Pohjola spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>No further details were immediately available.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom, 358-9-68050 235</p>
